# What the two test gates emit, and why only half of it is transient.
#
# `__screenshots__/` is NOT here: the baselines ARE the test, and a visual
# regression harness whose expected values live only on one laptop is a
# screenshot script. They are committed, per platform, and reviewed in the diff.
#
# Everything below is a run artefact — the received image, the pixel diff and
# the jsonl the runner summarises. Regenerated on every run, worth uploading as
# a CI artifact, never worth a commit.
test-results/

# The built Storybook the runner serves. Also ignored at the repo root; repeated
# here so this directory is self-describing when it is installed as a package.
storybook-static/
